  "voices": {
    "zh": {
      "一个月一次，我们可以慢慢期待。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-02a3f96e8b435be7.mp3",
      "好，我也给自己泡一杯。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-03e2631c95694902.mp3",
      "我会与董事会确认工时和授权范围，再和你核对生活安排。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-0dcd34656a35a657.mp3",
      "我知道，但有时候需要你提醒。我没做好也依然是我。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-0e75af8f8506c189.mp3",
      "我会很高兴，也会尊重你和朋友的时间。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-104871ca28b37a99.mp3",
      "谢谢你。先站远一点，我把碎片收好。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-14fec6a0edc2940f.mp3",
      "我只想成为那个让你高兴回家见到的人。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-16186f4ecdbf8d75.mp3",
      "那今天也请你问问，我需要什么。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-1674df0eecb26c9a.mp3",
      "谢谢，我确实需要歇一会儿。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-16c49b27fb970871.mp3",
      "谢谢你愿意和我一起把事实弄清楚。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-1af64d180019722f.mp3",
      "谢谢你，我很高兴你喜欢。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-1e481bec086f3393.mp3",
      "我拿刷子，你拿收纳盒，我们别用手捡。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-1e6d89b4dc8ad616.mp3",
      "有一点吃醋，但我相信你。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-1ef9fe376ee0cf60.mp3",
      "没有固定表演，只有我们真心愿意的事。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-221fbd12b7af02bc.mp3",
      "我们把主导、照顾和休息都写成可以再商量的约定。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-2aab32949d2d8f99.mp3",
      "我很喜欢做饭，也会告诉你需要休息的时候。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-2b58ffc9c4e6aaad.mp3",
      "我已经有些分不清，自己真正想要什么了。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-2d56c43a57099dee.mp3",
      "先约好休息期限与复盘日期，不把今天的疲惫变成永远。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-34d7d0c775966443.mp3",
      "我不会用下跪来要求你原谅我。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-34e1f1dbe3fcb834.mp3",
      "这些数字支撑不了估值。拿一份更好的方案来。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-374c093632538c97.mp3",
      "我们把最重要的两件事做完，留时间休息，好吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-3a8f2583c0b330bc.mp3",
      "我拿不准你想吃什么。哪一份能胜出？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-3bbdbbe504041041.mp3",
      "今天有一个很难的决定，我正想和你说。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-3cd5b6e90d48e01e.mp3",
      "我会问，也允许你有不想说的时候。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-3dbb83bb69562331.mp3",
      "我可以喜欢听你安排，也仍然做我自己。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-405794d0cc75297b.mp3",
      "我会按时间把文件和经过说清楚，不跳过难解释的部分。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-43e989d304b8760c.mp3",
      "欢迎回家，亲爱的。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-44986f60d453f961.mp3",
      "好了，这样就妥当了。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-45c04645a5e886ac.mp3",
      "你那位非常帅的丈夫，正耐心等着你。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-46ce5bb226443aa0.mp3",
      "我来准备菜单，你把不想吃的告诉我。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-486354c71c417c87.mp3",
      "我愿意跟随，也会说出自己的需要。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-490b018dcbf60150.mp3",
      "我很愿意。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-4923b37b34035cd4.mp3",
      "我可以再靠近一点吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-4c31b46a11347fdb.mp3",
      "可以，我很舒服。任何时候想换一种方式都可以说。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-4de014d5889c41dc.mp3",
      "如果我不再是亿万富翁，你还愿意和我在一起吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-4eeb72c626d9e537.mp3",
      "对，我们先保护隐私，再由律师保存证据。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-50d1ba58a7a52320.mp3",
      "你会觉得难堪吗？你可以对我说实话。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-5434adc0dc4a8823.mp3",
      "我想先听清你的意思。你希望我怎样回应？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-544b25917b7fb479.mp3",
      "乐意效劳，只属于我们愿意的这一刻。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-565820c643362ecb.mp3",
      "去玩得开心，不用一直看手机。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-56b0d934e931d5de.mp3",
      "我想记住这些微小的事情。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-56f3c02e59b3a107.mp3",
      "我们可以把这变成自己的传统吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-58e02ebd08fce81f.mp3",
      "欢迎回家，亲爱的。我做好晚饭了，可以帮你拿包吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-5a943c8dffa55e18.mp3",
      "我尊重你的决定。后续由我们各自的律师处理，不把告别变成挽留。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-5bdb968f939ed5bd.mp3",
      "爱我的妻子，不会让我失去工作的能力。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-5caa79a892d5e5db.mp3",
      "原本只属于我们的私密时刻，被人传出去了。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-6109330ebbd715bc.mp3",
      "结婚六个月快乐，我的爱人。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-625b3ef8d46f2e51.mp3",
      "我去把酱汁端来。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-6566c595eb0e2ecb.mp3",
      "我会吃醋，但不想控制你的生活。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-66997b16687f01f6.mp3",
      "那我今天选粉色，明天还可以换。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-6e86730aca3ed745.mp3",
      "每周留一天给你安排，遇到临时事情我们再商量。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-6fd55afc00ff97e5.mp3",
      "当然，小心烫。你随时可以自己来。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-70992fd73fe0955f.mp3",
      "法式吐司还温热着。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-76654a55a04ed159.mp3",
      "如果两种梦想暂时冲突，我们先谈时间和边界，不替任何人放弃。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-76c0c9fb1ea227d8.mp3",
      "我今天做得好吗？我真的很喜欢听你亲口说。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-77f346bafd3cbc0c.mp3",
      "我想记住这句话，而不是逼你反复证明。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-7cc4302412ab8ce5.mp3",
      "那我大概是纽约最幸运的乖老公。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-7e3d80d0dc24c01f.mp3",
      "我会按程序交接。这是我的职业选择，不是你索取的证明。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-82912e31b3a109d6.mp3",
      "往后的每一天，我们都可以重新决定。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-83003aec728927f0.mp3",
      "明天只留给我们。今晚玩得开心。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-84894000523fafeb.mp3",
      "我仍喜欢为你做饭，但不必再靠它换取被爱。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-85bd34a910af7af4.mp3",
      "我会到客房去。有实际需要再联系，不追着你要回应。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-89f166001fe46d37.mp3",
      "谢谢。一起面对，不代表你必须立刻原谅。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-8ab2ffd40bb25e83.mp3",
      "你愿意和我一起面对吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-8d7abdd5e0b9f8d5.mp3",
      "对不起，我知道你很喜欢这个盘子。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-8fee155d54dda9c1.mp3",
      "如果我失去了一切，你还会爱我吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-903dbec57d154e9d.mp3",
      "可以吗？力度不舒服就告诉我。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-91cb95a6b399bb8b.mp3",
      "我想要的正是这样，不必一直当英雄。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-91f626ed6d0c8fa1.mp3",
      "什么样的生活，才适合我们？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-946c6d0b34104224.mp3",
      "下次轮到我，想让你也被好好邀请一次。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-956fb9115ff65518.mp3",
      "不用勉强自己，我们把需要告诉对方。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-974b3af4ebed67d1.mp3",
      "外面是西装，家里可以是粉色围裙。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-9998dfa96ebd8a66.mp3",
      "谢谢你。我不会替你公开表达任何偏好。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-9cbeece8db9f4345.mp3",
      "好，我也想和你一起好好吃饭。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-9cd22fa987fcf43a.mp3",
      "不用安排得很满，和你待着就很好。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-9e7fc9c96a510286.mp3",
      "松饼给你。以后想换口味，直接告诉我。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-a5dd025e279d50a3.mp3",
      "粉色、白色还是深蓝色？说实话就好。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-a72d9729c98cbe3c.mp3",
      "你希望我们接下来怎样生活？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-af3831c2bc517de3.mp3",
      "我想和你过所有平凡的日子，包括艰难的那些。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-af7b3b8ea2e8a81a.mp3",
      "我签了公司治理协议，但拒绝了披露私生活的附加条款。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-b10ad93965edd298.mp3",
      "只要你愿意，我当然很高兴。按你觉得舒服的方式来。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-b2db43812640fd4f.mp3",
      "我不会因为表现出对你的爱而难为情。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-b3eff28bfd74b21a.mp3",
      "这是我自己的选择，我依然是我。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-b6cbda5a9d338475.mp3",
      "好，我们一起挑时间。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-b82da6ced3e0d034.mp3",
      "我喜欢迎接你回家。你也喜欢吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-b884bb3ce7ae3023.mp3",
      "听你这样说，我真的很开心。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-bb413230b453e98e.mp3",
      "好，工作留在家里，我们一起出去。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-c286e1fc47a227ad.mp3",
      "七点。如果会议拖延，我会先告诉你。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-c9fe17edd53e1d26.mp3",
      "我愿意，在这里陪你。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-cc65602e311cdb79.mp3",
      "好，不急着给我一个答案。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-cccf33fc4febf470.mp3",
      "我可以在这里待一会儿吗？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-d089a40dd81ef738.mp3",
      "我推荐松饼；你尝过后再决定喜不喜欢。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-d127639ca8dd53bf.mp3",
      "因为我喜欢迎接你；我也可以站着，你喜欢哪一种？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-d5c847ec754338ca.mp3",
      "这绝对是我收到过最好的评价。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-d64f8f3f149c64cc.mp3",
      "这不公平，你明知道这会让我脸红。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-d708e03202d45893.mp3",
      "深蓝色，收到。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-d8e2e775d7914d9a.mp3",
      "不是逃开问题。我们约好期限和复盘，把新生活一步步落地。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-db759fd8bbede041.mp3",
      "每天都重新选择，而不是把承诺当成枷锁。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-dd88d532bd52feb8.mp3",
      "我喜欢我们都能被照顾。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-e3415664513645ef.mp3",
      "我们从真实的预算和愿望开始，不急着作英雄式决定。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-e55f8085c69c52d4.mp3",
      "从明天的早餐开始，我们轮流照顾彼此。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-e73f2873ff9bc77c.mp3",
      "三分熟，按你喜欢的口味做的。尝起来怎么样？": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-f151882737df97e2.mp3",
      "我需要一点时间，想清楚自己想要什么。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-f67b91be4184cece.mp3",
      "今天听你的。我想知道你真正想做什么。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-f7a39ba75e68a0dd.mp3",
      "我也很想你。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-f7c4593a16c6e4d4.mp3",
      "粉色，好。今天我也正想穿它。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-f86ba143f4666492.mp3",
      "别忘了，我们也要一起开心。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-f94d1680cf7672ed.mp3",
      "我会认真考虑怎样继续工作，也把边界说清楚。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-fac487eec167ed75.mp3",
      "我的女王。如果你哪天不喜欢了，告诉我就好。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-fb12a838a92ba2a9.mp3",
      "好，只在我们都愿意时；任何时候都能改。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-fb3ea9290171b19a.mp3",
      "我知道自己有点紧张。幸好不用在你面前完美。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-fba0254dfdf7bff9.mp3",
      "每一句都是真心话。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-fc5b9f7670b50a8c.mp3",
      "白色，很清爽。": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/zh-fdcf1c87707a876a.mp3"
    },
    "en": {
      "I just want to be the guy you’re happy to come home to.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-00c105a4d213a184.mp3",
      "Would you still want me if I wasn’t a billionaire?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-011e80ce6613248a.mp3",
      "Loving my wife doesn’t make me less capable.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-01c7205cc994004f.mp3",
      "I enjoy cooking, and I will say when I need a rest.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-0290f9c908e5e99f.mp3",
      "My queen. Tell me whenever you want a different name.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-033a40ab0773ad9b.mp3",
      "Yes. I would like to enjoy dinner with you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-06cba376fe3c6720.mp3",
      "The numbers don’t support the valuation. Bring me a better proposal.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-06d8b4c5ee1614c0.mp3",
      "I missed you, too.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-074e7d64335976c4.mp3",
      "Every day, freely. A promise should not become a cage.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-082a564c693c4b78.mp3",
      "My turn next. I want to invite you properly, too.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-0af86d5477b741e2.mp3",
      "I signed the governance agreement, but refused the private disclosure addendum.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-0b301824cccba52a.mp3",
      "I get jealous, but I do not want to control your life.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-0d4f31706b3f3fdc.mp3",
      "I can love following your lead and still be myself.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-0d74e6142cdcd7da.mp3",
      "Can we make this our thing?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-0de5f2200d390073.mp3",
      "Yes. Let us protect our privacy and preserve the evidence.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-0fe00df383e91eec.mp3",
      "White. Nice and simple.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-10159537df6a8ebf.mp3",
      "Starting with breakfast tomorrow, we take turns caring for each other.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-147dde6a4628678e.mp3",
      "I need some time to decide what I want.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-14f2359a2d1fc9bf.mp3",
      "I’m not asking you to forgive me because I’m kneeling.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-17ef34935cf579c8.mp3",
      "Pink, white, or navy? Be honest.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-196cb9560c513ad6.mp3",
      "I wanted to remember the little things.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-1b45374df8d9203a.mp3",
      "I will consider how to keep working and make the boundaries clear.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-1b946c986aaf7e19.mp3",
      "Can I stay here a minute?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-21649fb54c2bf742.mp3",
      "I will arrange a proper handover. This is my career decision, not proof you demanded.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-2380bfeaecd796d5.mp3",
      "Medium rare. Just the way you like it. Well?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-24099b77c5d3ae25.mp3",
      "Thank you. I am glad you like it.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-248f4c374a3a9fd0.mp3",
      "No pretending. We tell each other what we need.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-2542d4e9a9079644.mp3",
      "Every word. I meant every word.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-25c05748ba805b9a.mp3",
      "I would love to come, and respect your time with your friends.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-297731ce54a4654b.mp3",
      "I want all the ordinary days, even the hard ones.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-2cbc1b820abc5510.mp3",
      "Then I choose pink today. Tomorrow can be different.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-300c1905503a267f.mp3",
      "That’s not fair. You know exactly what that does to me.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-3211869547561509.mp3",
      "Let us start with real budgets and wishes, not grand gestures.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-34ebd9ee876f9897.mp3",
      "I would love to.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-3736ec41338c7ad0.mp3",
      "Only when we both want it. We can change our minds.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-3a1ca7526c8167d4.mp3",
      "I want to be sure I understand. What would you like me to do?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-3ae1abab88c378c9.mp3",
      "Would you still love me if I lost everything?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-3db9505e814bba12.mp3",
      "Then ask me what I need sometimes, too.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-3f107bb8dd77d7af.mp3",
      "At your service, for this moment we both choose.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-3fdbf08b28b567af.mp3",
      "Of course. I will make a cup for myself, too.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-40f9f04efe913cc5.mp3",
      "Seven. If a meeting runs late, I will tell you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-41754048dfca5e5a.mp3",
      "I want to remember that, not make you prove it repeatedly.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-45f62f2e29a5d566.mp3",
      "Navy. Got it.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-465c901e417a37d1.mp3",
      "I respect your decision. Our lawyers can handle the practical matters. I will not turn goodbye into a demand to stay.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-496871fb73f95084.mp3",
      "Thank you for choosing me.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-49b512a729386397.mp3",
      "May I come a little closer?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-4b07aa218960b612.mp3",
      "When our ambitions conflict, we negotiate time and boundaries before asking either to give up.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-4d37e8000c13e868.mp3",
      "Tomorrow is ours. Enjoy tonight.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-4ef6f89d21645009.mp3",
      "I couldn’t decide what you’d want. Which one wins?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-5377af878e71317a.mp3",
      "I will get the brush. Let us not pick up shards by hand.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-562546453ed731e0.mp3",
      "I am comfortable. Tell me whenever you want something different.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-5766e79f82ddc7ef.mp3",
      "I will ask, and leave room for days when you do not want to talk.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-584ddea6d99af949.mp3",
      "That makes me happy to hear.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-5a4dcf1ccff086af.mp3",
      "You chose me?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-5b63bd0ed378ebe5.mp3",
      "Happy six months, my love.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-5de656759830656f.mp3",
      "I would love to follow, and still speak about what I need.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-5fafaf0ec8eccf42.mp3",
      "Something private between us is out there.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-61e1fb888ea90dce.mp3",
      "I would like to stay here with you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-6b83977be79f085e.mp3",
      "Thank you. I will not disclose your preferences on your behalf.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-6c0177c20ec07e81.mp3",
      "We are not escaping the problem. We set a timetable and build the new routine step by step.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-706ae44c92d6e392.mp3",
      "Thank you. Stand clear while I gather the pieces.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-721337b6d57022eb.mp3",
      "Of course. Careful, it is warm. Take over whenever you like.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-73452fac9eb29d52.mp3",
      "Your day. Your choice. I’d love to know what you want.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-7776416b309a0e03.mp3",
      "I will plan a menu. Tell me what you do not want.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-8176757718299b38.mp3",
      "I like welcoming you home. Does it feel good to you, too?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-82fcb8d7904229b5.mp3",
      "There. Perfect.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-837b02b3014ce255.mp3",
      "May I? Tell me if the pressure is too much.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-88fb4bc12feaea5e.mp3",
      "Once a month gives us something lovely to look forward to.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-897c031fbd479325.mp3",
      "Let us finish the two important things and leave room to rest.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-8b2c3787a7ef2ebe.mp3",
      "Business suit outside. Pink apron at home.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-8ec95a79d4eb9156.mp3",
      "I will explain the documents and timeline, including the difficult parts.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-90713838aa859193.mp3",
      "Welcome home, sweetheart. I made dinner. May I take your bag?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-912ca11103bd3403.mp3",
      "Pink. I was hoping to wear it today.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-924cda87cf0c69d8.mp3",
      "That is what I wanted: not having to be a hero all the time.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-92a9436b90721b6a.mp3",
      "I like that both of us can be cared for.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-92c8e68cfe514306.mp3",
      "One day a week for your plans, with room to renegotiate.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-95a10da25c9878ad.mp3",
      "Thank you. Facing it together does not require instant forgiveness.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-95d0cc682cb8e3b1.mp3",
      "I’m sorry. I know it was your favorite.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-96186f55ac8bdcb2.mp3",
      "Thank you. I could use a rest.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-9747a3f132b84a9a.mp3",
      "A little. But I trust you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-97e8a678af476551.mp3",
      "I still love cooking for you. I just don’t need to earn love with it.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-99f74f6807530e28.mp3",
      "I know I panicked a little. I am glad I do not have to be perfect with you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-9a203096eee7bbcf.mp3",
      "I will bring the sauce.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-9a69e29194f04a21.mp3",
      "I choose it. I’m still myself.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-9f968de0d918c522.mp3",
      "Because I like welcoming you. I can stand, too. What feels right?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-9ffd6b39f7b01871.mp3",
      "I know. Sometimes I need reminding that I can have an imperfect day.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-a9450e1bb3abd1a5.mp3",
      "There was a difficult decision today. I wanted to tell you about it.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-b398a509751c4c19.mp3",
      "I’m not embarrassed to act like I love you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-ba5fc562efe4d2e7.mp3",
      "Best review I have ever had.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-bc84f2b851c11e9e.mp3",
      "Take your time. You do not owe me an immediate answer.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-bc9bb8bc4ce1b6e6.mp3",
      "Then I am the luckiest good husband in New York.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-c3fe2dd8a3f518ce.mp3",
      "Let us set a break and a review date, rather than making exhaustion permanent.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-c47ae15fe4ca9a29.mp3",
      "I’d love that. Whatever feels right to you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-c530f10e550b602f.mp3",
      "I will use the guest room. I will not chase you for a reply.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-c5b959df2e11c91a.mp3",
      "I recommend the pancakes. Try them before deciding whether you like them.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-c946644bae53d490.mp3",
      "Let us choose a time together.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-cb8bd9ec53fb614b.mp3",
      "I don’t know what I want anymore.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-ce1fd78fbebfb2fa.mp3",
      "We make leadership, care and rest agreements we can revisit.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-d12f49deeae421d4.mp3",
      "The French toast is still warm.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-d4e2c1dbb165933f.mp3",
      "I will confirm workload and delegation, then discuss our routine with you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-dbaba077af12c9b7.mp3",
      "Was I good today? I really like hearing it from you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-dcd3010876550914.mp3",
      "Have a good time. You do not have to keep checking your phone.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-de286692f08870da.mp3",
      "Your very handsome husband is patiently waiting.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-dfe03ee11d5a4323.mp3",
      "What kind of life do you want us to have?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-e947864771bcbaa5.mp3",
      "Are you embarrassed? You can tell me the truth.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-e94b9bfb050f279c.mp3",
      "Welcome home, sweetheart.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-ead01a75cf48356b.mp3",
      "No performance. Just what we honestly want.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-ee0b72468fee0e93.mp3",
      "Pancakes it is. Tell me whenever you want something different.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-f0cd006820c3575c.mp3",
      "Never forget to have fun.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-f4902ddf399884a3.mp3",
      "What kind of life feels right for us?": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-f9156600c5ddb91f.mp3",
      "Every day, we choose what comes next.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-f99b47f2501b8aa5.mp3",
      "We do not need a full schedule. I like being with you.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-fb4365f78a632afa.mp3",
      "Yes. Let us leave work at home and go out.": "art/official/m110-husband-v3-1/voice/en-fc654c75b133fe12.mp3"
    }
  },
  "endings": {
    "A": {
      "t": {
        "zh": "女王与自由的心",
        "en": "A Queen and a Willing Heart"
      },
      "txt": {
        "zh": "你们保留女性主导的相处方式，也把休息、拒绝与重新协商写进共同约定。阿德里安有自己的事业决定；围裙与迎接仪式只在双方愿意时出现。门再次打开，他先问今天需要什么，而不是完成一场必须得到好评的表演。",
        "en": "You keep a female-led relationship with room for rest, refusal and revision. Adrian retains his own career decisions. The apron and greeting rituals happen only by mutual choice. When the door opens, he asks what you want today instead of performing for approval."
      },
      "line": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      }
    },
    "B": {
      "t": {
        "zh": "彼此的家",
        "en": "A Home for Both of You"
      },
      "txt": {
        "zh": "家务与照顾开始轮流安排。忙碌的一方可以先休息，另一方也能把自己的需要说出来。阿德里安依然会撒娇，也依然喜欢为你做饭，但再没有人必须靠服务换取被爱。",
        "en": "You begin sharing care and household work. Whoever is exhausted can rest; both can say what they need. Adrian remains affectionate and enjoys cooking for you, but neither of you has to earn love through service."
      },
      "line": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      }
    },
    "C": {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两种梦想，一张餐桌",
        "en": "Two Dreams, One Table"
      },
      "txt": {
        "zh": "你们没有用一场告白消除职业冲突，而是把工作时段、陪伴时间和各自不可退让的目标逐项谈清。若此前的事业计划不再适合，新的安排须经阿德里安本人同意后再调整。下一次复盘写进日历，爱情与现实都被认真对待。",
        "en": "A declaration does not erase incompatible career needs. You negotiate work hours, time together and non-negotiable goals. Any revision to the earlier career plan requires Adrian’s own agreement. A review date goes into the calendar: love and practical reality both receive attention."
      },
      "line": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      }
    },
    "D": {
      "t": {
        "zh": "重新学习生活",
        "en": "Learning a New Rhythm"
      },
      "txt": {
        "zh": "你们选择一起换一种生活节奏，不把搬家或休假当作万能答案。预算、工作交接与试行期限被写清；如果原先决定继续担任总裁，是否改变仍由他确认。你们先过好一段普通日子，再讨论更远的未来。",
        "en": "You choose a different rhythm together without treating a move or a holiday as a cure. You agree on budgets, any handover and a trial period. If he previously chose to remain CEO, changing that decision still requires his agreement. You begin with ordinary days before deciding the distant future."
      },
      "line": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      }
    },
    "E": {
      "t": {
        "zh": "各自的明天",
        "en": "Separate Tomorrows"
      },
      "txt": {
        "zh": "你选择结束婚姻关系。阿德里安难过，却没有要求最后一次拥抱、继续等待或日后复合。财务与手续交给各自的专业代理处理，私人影像与个人资料按双方要求妥善处理。你走向自己的生活；这不是等待他把你追回来的过场。",
        "en": "You choose to end the marriage. Adrian is hurt, but asks for neither a final embrace nor a promise to wait or reconcile. Independent advisers handle practical and financial arrangements, and private recordings and personal data are handled according to your wishes. You move toward your own life. This is not a pause before he wins you back."
      },
      "line": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      }
    }
  }
}
